      "semantics": "true keeps the steps in the cases that used the set and false removes them from those cases as well. Passed as the driver's keepInCases option, which sends the 1 or 0 TestRail documents. Omitting the body sends no field at all, leaving TestRail's default of keeping them, which is a third state rather than a synonym for true.",
      "driver": {
